   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Qwen-Image 2.1 Turbo \u00b7 Text to Image\n**Model:** `Turbo Q8_0 GGUF` by default (near-lossless). Flip the yellow switch to `true` to use `Turbo FP8` instead; only the selected loader is loaded.\n\n**Size:** ResolutionSelector drives the latent. 1.0 MP \u2248 1024\u00b2, **4.0 MP = native 2048\u00b2** (Qwen's Turbo presets are ~4 MP, e.g. 1680\u00d72512). Keep multiples of 32.\n\n**Transparent (RGBA) output:** wrap the prompt like\n`This is an RGBA format image with transparency. [your subject]. The image has an alpha channel and a transparent background.`\n\n**Sampling (Turbo):** the checkpoint's own 8-step schedule in *Turbo schedule* (ManualSigmas), euler, cfg **1**. Changing the steps means editing that list; Qwen hasn't evaluated other schedules. The negative prompt is ignored at cfg 1."
   ],
   "title": "Notes"
  }
